      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hatley Castle, now home to Royal Roads University, was originally a Scottish Baronial mansion for Premier James Dunsmuir.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colwood%2C_British_Columbia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Esquimalt Lagoon, part of Colwood’s waterfront, hosts a National Migratory Bird Sanctuary where thousands of shorebirds nest each spring.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
